<https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/foxxi> a owl:Ontology ;
    dct:title "Foxxi Content Intelligence vocabulary"@en ;
    dct:description "The vocabulary the Foxxi vertical emits: the xAPI verbs, activity types and context extensions its statements carry — typed with ADL's xAPI ontology classes, as the Foxxi xAPI Profile declares them — and the classes of the records it publishes to learner and tenant pods. It composes the standards ontologies it emerges from (rdfs:seeAlso)."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An original vocabulary of the Foxxi vertical, by Mark Spivey (Foxxi Mediums Inc.). It formalizes no standard; its xAPI concepts are typed with classes of ADL's xAPI ontology (https://w3id.org/xapi/ontology), which is not affiliated with or endorsing this vocabulary."@en ,
        "Path-structured term names (verbs/…, activities/…) are part of the IRI: <https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/foxxi#verbs/asked> is one term. The Turtle writes such IRIs in full, which every reader takes; as a prefixed name the slash would have to be escaped (foxxi:verbs\\/asked)."@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/foxxi/2026.10.1> ;
    owl:versionInfo "2026.10.1" ;
    owl:priorVersion <https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/foxxi/2026.10.0> ;
    owl:backwardCompatibleWith <https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/foxxi/2026.10.0> ;
    skos:historyNote "Versioned by calendar (YYYY.MM.PATCH) from 2026.10.0: the version numbers this document, not the standard it formalizes. Every released version stays resolvable at its version IRI, and the content there never changes. Earlier publications carried no version IRI, and their owl:versionInfo restated the version of the standard."@en ;
    dct:creator "Mark Spivey" ;
    dct:contributor "Claude (Anthropic)" ;
    dct:publisher "Foxxi Mediums Inc." ;
    dct:license <https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT> ;
    dct:rights "© 2026 Mark Spivey (Foxxi Mediums Inc.). Released under the MIT License."@en ;
    dct:created "2026-05-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:modified "2026-10-13"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:issued "2026-10-13"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:language <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-1/en> ;
    bibo:status <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status/published> ;
    dct:bibliographicCitation "Spivey, M. (2026). Foxxi Content Intelligence vocabulary (Version 2026.10.1) [Ontology]. Foxxi Mediums Inc. https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/foxxi/2026.10.1" ;
    vann:preferredNamespacePrefix "foxxi" ;
    vann:preferredNamespaceUri "https://foxxi-bridge.interego.xwisee.com/ns/foxxi#" ;
